"Bad response for initial list windows request: %@" = "初始列出窗口请求的响应无效：%@";
"Too many tmux windows!" = "tmux 窗口过多！";
"Use the tmux dashboard to select which to open." = "请使用 tmux 控制面板选择要打开的窗口。";
