"tmux is not in UTF-8 mode. Please pass the -u command line argument to tmux or change your LANG environment variable to end with “.UTF-8”." = "tmux 未处于 UTF-8 模式。请向 tmux 传递 -u 命令行参数，或将您的 LANG 环境变量改为以“.UTF-8”结尾。";
"UTF-8 Mode Not Detected" = "未检测到 UTF-8 模式";
"The \"%@\" option is turned on in tmux. It is not compatible with the iTerm2-tmux integration. Please disable it and try again." = "tmux 中已开启“%@”选项。该选项与 iTerm2-tmux 集成不兼容。请将其关闭后重试。";
"Unsupported tmux option" = "不支持的 tmux 选项";
"While attaching to tmux, some tabs were found whose color is pure red. This may be due to a bug in early versions of iTerm2 3.6.x. Would you like to reset those tabs’ colors?" = "在附加到 tmux 时，发现部分标签页的颜色为纯红色。这可能是由于 iTerm2 3.6.x 早期版本中的一个 bug 导致。是否要重置这些标签页的颜色？";
"Reset" = "重置";
"Keep Red" = "保持红色";
"Fix corrupted tab colors?" = "修复损坏的标签页颜色？";
"Bad response for list windows request: %@" = "列出窗口请求的响应无效：%@";
"Error opening tmux tab" = "打开 tmux 标签页时出错";
"A tmux pane terminated immediately after creation" = "tmux 面板在创建后立即终止";
"Unrecognized command from tmux. Did your ssh session die? The command was:" = "从 tmux 收到无法识别的命令。你的 ssh 会话是否已断开？该命令是：";

"** ERROR **" = "** 错误 **";

"tmux exited unexpectedly." = "tmux 意外退出。";
